# The live system sets up its console itself: .automated_script.sh loads the
# font and the configurator runs loadkeys for the layout the user picks.
# systemd's rule restarts systemd-vconsole-setup whenever a console binds,
# which on the live ISO is fbcon taking over tty1 as the installer's getty
# starts; its loadkeys then races agetty's hangup and fails with EIO.
